libdeflate 1.24 (Eric Biggers), MIT license (COPYING).
Source: https://github.com/ebiggers/libdeflate/archive/refs/tags/v1.24.tar.gz
        sha256 ad8d3723d0065c4723ab738be9723f2ff1cb0f1571e8bfcf0301ff9661f475e8

Vendored unmodified (whole release tree). ThirdParty/CMakeLists.txt builds only the decompression side
(adler32, deflate_decompress, zlib_decompress, utils, x86/cpu_features) as the static target "libdeflate".

Use: Mopaq/SComp.cpp zlib_decompress tries libdeflate_zlib_decompress first, one decompressor per thread;
any libdeflate error retries the sector with zlib. CVar mpqFastInflate (default 1, 0 = zlib only).
A warm-up decompress runs during static initialization, because libdeflate's CPU-feature dispatch races
when its first call comes from several MPQ worker threads at once.
